This is an independent Dutch-learning adaptation. Original author notices and
license are preserved. New course material, homepage, Dutch speech selection,
Unicode tokenization, local lookup and deployment configuration were added.
Original English resources and original documentation remain for provenance;
the Dutch course lists load only the new Dutch resources.

Dutch word grammar added 2026-11-11: POS annotations, articles, person/tense
tables and authored usage notes. The selected and corrected verb principal
parts derive in part from Pattern (University of Antwerp / CLiPS), BSD-3-Clause.
The full third-party notice is preserved in content/grammar/PATTERN-LICENSE.txt;
the pinned source and modifications are recorded in content/grammar/source.json.
